cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "rsemverse: Read RSEM Gene-Level Results as Gene Symbol Tables"
authors:
  - family-names: Kumakura
    given-names: Daiki
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9859-0720"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/rsemverse"
url: "https://daikikumakura.github.io/software/rsemverse.html"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An R package whose function rsem_read() reads RSEM *.genes.results files listed in a sample table (sample_id, ref) and returns expected counts or TPM as a data frame with one row per gene symbol and one column per sample, using org.Hs.eg.db or org.Mm.eg.db for human or mouse.
keywords:
  - "RNA-seq"
  - "RSEM"
  - "gene symbol"
  - "R package"
